1
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,390
♪Don't stay trapped inside your room♪

2
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:09,790
♪Outside the window,
the rain has cleared♪

3
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:11,070
♪Set reality aside♪

4
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:12,390
♪Follow your heart♪

5
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:13,750
♪What you've been longing
for is right ahead♪

6
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,230
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

7
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:18,110
♪Just be a little braver♪

8
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,870
♪Come closer, come closer♪

9
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:23,950
♪There's a little spark
shining in your eyes♪

10
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,070
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

11
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:29,790
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

12
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:33,820
=Heart Signal (China Version) S9=
(Bonus Edition)

13
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:36,300
(After the confession)

14
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,540
(Cui Kaiyi & Cao Yiheng return
to Couples House)

15
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,000
Alright.

16
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,440
Come on, change your shoes.

17
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,580
(Hug)

18
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,280
Let's go.

19
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,800
Let's head out.

20
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,480
Do you want

21
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,680
to put your gift upstairs first?

22
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:51,120
Sure.

23
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,580
I'm taking the bouquet with me.

24
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:54,060
(Joking)
To show it off.

25
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:54,440
You hold it.

26
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,640
It goes so well with my outfit.

27
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,160
This is my look for today.

28
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:00,520
You know?

29
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,120
Yeah.

30
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:02,720
I'm keeping it with me.

31
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:04,440
It's so pretty.

32
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:05,400
I love it.

33
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:11,380
(Yu Yang & Liang Renfang return
to Couples House)

34
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:15,240
Hey, beautiful.

35
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,600
Hello.

36
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:17,640
I had a feeling

37
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,520
it would be you two.

38
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,480
You're so pretty.

39
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,180
You're pretty too.

40
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,600
Anyone else here?

41
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:25,800
No, just the four of us.

42
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,400
I'm going to put something away.

43
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:27,920
Okay.

44
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:28,400
Bye bye.

45
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,120
It's okay, come on in.

46
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,040
Can I come in?

47
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:37,400
Sure, you can sit on my bed.

48
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,120
That's my bed over there.

49
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:39,920
You can sit there.

50
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:43,900
(Cui Yihang & Wu Siying return
to Couples House)

51
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,200
Hi.

52
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,280
Hello.

53
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,120
You're back.

54
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:49,680
We're back.

55
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,520
Let's get each other's WeChat.

56
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,000
- Yeah, let's add each other on WeChat.
- WeChat, right?

57
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:52,280
Yeah.

58
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:52,920
Let's do it.

59
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,160
Here.

60
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,360
Let's swap WeChat IDs.

61
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,240
I'll scan yours first.

62
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,600
Hi.

63
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:58,040
Hello.

64
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,640
So pretty.

65
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,280
Hi.

66
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,680
Cui Kaiyi, can I add you on WeChat?

67
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,320
Of course.

68
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:01,840
I'll scan yours.

69
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,200
Let's just make a group chat.

70
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,360
Yu Yang.

71
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,840
Let's add each other on WeChat.

72
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,840
I'll scan yours.

73
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,400
Si, you look so pretty.

74
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,560
I love your dress.

75
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,160
Thanks. Yours looks great too.

76
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,000
It's yellow.

77
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,880
It feels like we're back
in the Yellow Space.

78
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:16,480
Yeah.

79
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:21,000
Come on, there's a barbecue over there.

80
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,480
Okay, let's go check it out.

81
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,920
(Meal time)
What kind of skewers are these?

82
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:38,880
They're all meat.

83
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,960
I think I hear thunder.

84
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,120
It's going to rain soon.

85
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,000
You know what?

86
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,680
If we stand there reading our letters,

87
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,840
it'll start pouring

88
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,640
the next second.

89
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,760
It's like we have some kind
of "summoning spell".

90
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:53,920
I feel like I suddenly got taller.

91
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:54,760
My girl has grown up.

92
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,940
(My girl has grown up)

93
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,760
My girl has grown up.

94
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:05,920
What a feast.

95
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:10,780
(Feeding)

96
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,240
This one's good.

97
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,280
The strawberries are sour.

98
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:19,080
I want some of this fried rice.

99
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,040
Let's get a plate.

100
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,440
I want to grill something impressive.

101
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:23,080
Something impressive.

102
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,280
Shrimp.

103
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,320
Let me have a bite

104
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:37,840
first.

105
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,920
Sorry, the spoon.

106
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,920
This spoon.

107
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:40,720
It's the serving spoon.

108
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,120
Yeah.

109
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,280
Then I'll get one.

110
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,200
Our own spoons.

111
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:56,320
I think what I'll never forget
is the fried rice

112
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,040
in Thailand.

113
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:59,120
I think every fried rice dish
was delicious.

114
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,080
And also that.

115
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:01,560
So good.

116
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,440
Mango sticky rice.

117
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:02,760
Here.

118
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:03,720
We'll get some more later.

119
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:06,600
Eat some more. There's still plenty.

120
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,680
I want some more.

121
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,640
Okay, I'll get you some.

122
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,280
Here.

123
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:14,040
Let's take your water

124
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:16,160
to the beanbag chair.

125
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,520
I'll sit with you.

126
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:24,360
(Closer)
Why are all the chairs so far apart?

127
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,760
We're waiting to watch the sunrise.

128
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:32,320
What's wrong?

129
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,760
It's "on fire".

130
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:34,920
The lamb skewers.

131
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,080
The "professional" is here.

132
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,720
The "professional".

133
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,680
The "professional" grill master

134
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,160
is on the job.

135
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:45,760
Smells so good.

136
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:50,220
(Holding hands)

137
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,640
The master chef is back at it.

138
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,900
You grill it the best.

139
00:04:58,900 --> 00:04:59,840
(You grill it the best)

140
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,080
I'm only grilling for you.

141
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:02,920
(I'm only grilling for you)

142
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,640
No, you can't.

143
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:05,680
Are you okay?

144
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,320
It's really smoky.

145
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:08,040
The smoke comes from this angle.

146
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:11,360
What do you need? A spoon?

147
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,960
A spoon. Try this.

148
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,120
Rice.

149
00:05:16,180 --> 00:05:18,660
(Feeding)

150
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:20,480
What's going on?

151
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,320
What else do you want to eat?

152
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,360
There are crabs.

153
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,480
Do you want some?

154
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,880
Maybe the spicy crab.

155
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,760
Is it a little too spicy for you?

156
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:40,840
That one's really spicy.

157
00:05:42,660 --> 00:05:43,780
(Grabbing a mangosteen)

158
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,920
You eat first.

159
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:52,680
So you're hungry?

160
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,560
Didn't you say you weren't eating rice?

161
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,140
(Teasing)

162
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,080
I "snuck" some.

163
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,160
When it rained today,

164
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,200
I just felt

165
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,800
so happy.

166
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:05,280
- Because we'd talked about it before.
- I was hoping...

167
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:06,960
- It rained.
- It would rain when we got here.

168
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:07,860
- Better.
- And then...

169
00:06:07,860 --> 00:06:09,240
- I was thinking the same thing.
- It stopped.

170
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:10,400
Wait.

171
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:11,920
Did it rain when you two confessed?

172
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,240
It did.

173
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,320
We didn't confess while it was raining.

174
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,340
We waited for the rain to stop,

175
00:06:15,340 --> 00:06:15,880
and then we confessed.

176
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:17,640
By the end of our confession,

177
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,560
it started pouring.

178
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,760
It poured the first time
we confessed too.

179
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:21,800
It started pouring,

180
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,800
and that was how it ended, you know?

181
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,160
So both times...

182
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,160
- Yeah.
- It was pretty "intense".

183
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:27,040
The rain started pouring
right after we finished.

184
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,400
It just came out of nowhere.

185
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,040
You didn't get soaked, did you?

186
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,320
Completely soaked.

187
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,600
It's on fire.

188
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,480
But you were really happy.

189
00:06:35,990 --> 00:06:36,780
Happy.

190
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:47,800
Come on.

191
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:48,640
It's cooked.

192
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,720
It's all cooked. Don't worry.

193
00:06:52,820 --> 00:06:53,980
(Trying)

194
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,480
Take a bite.

195
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:59,080
(Feeding)

196
00:06:59,080 --> 00:06:59,600
It's hot.

197
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,360
It's not hot.

198
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,240
It's fine.

199
00:07:06,420 --> 00:07:07,480
(Praising)
Is it good?

200
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,280
It's good.

201
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,160
Is it good?

202
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:11,920
It's good.

203
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,080
The fat on it is really good.

204
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,160
That white part in the middle.

205
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:17,520
Do you usually eat fattier cuts?

206
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:18,360
I do.

207
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,160
Not lamb.

208
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,200
Beef, yes.

209
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,760
What else do you want to eat?

210
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,640
I can tell you're really hungry.

211
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,600
Hello.

212
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,040
When did you get back?

213
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,360
I just got back.

214
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:42,000
This is quite a feast.

215
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,720
You came back by yourself?

216
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:43,880
Yeah.

217
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,520
Grab some food.

218
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:46,280
There's food

219
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:47,600
and fruit over there.

220
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,400
Try some.

221
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,520
Have a piece. Give it a try.

222
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,200
Join the group chat.

223
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,160
You guys already have a group chat?

224
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:58,800
Join us.

225
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,480
We just made one.

226
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,520
Add everyone one by one.

227
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,560
Wait,

228
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,080
can you two come add me?

229
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:03,680
Of course.

230
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,640
Let me...

231
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,040
Here, my phone.

232
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:07,920
I sent it to you.

233
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:09,600
Hold on.

234
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,400
Wow.

235
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,440
I'm coming!

236
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,280
- Come on.
- Scan it.

237
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:13,060
- Come on.
- Scan us.

238
00:08:13,060 --> 00:08:14,600
- Let's add each other on WeChat.
- Let's do it.

239
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,240
This part is so much fun.

240
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:16,960
Yeah.

241
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,360
Of course.

242
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,560
Come on.

243
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,160
Did you scan it?

244
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,160
Yep.

245
00:08:28,740 --> 00:08:29,980
(Feeding)

246
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:38,800
So sour.

247
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,840
Is yours sour?
Mine doesn't taste like anything.

248
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,760
This one is insanely sour.

249
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,520
But this one is sweet.

250
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:45,520
It's so weird.

251
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:47,840
One's sour, one's sweet.

252
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,200
I'll try another one.

253
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,560
Let me name the group first.

254
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:04,400
Let's call it...

255
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:07,560
"Heart Signal 9, Forever and Ever".

256
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,560
Wonderful.

257
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,360
Let's go with that for now.

258
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:10,840
Sure.

259
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:11,840
I hope everyone chats more.

260
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,560
And keeps in touch.

261
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,800
Okay.

262
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:15,000
I'll send ten stickers first.

263
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,400
I'm sending them now.

264
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:20,600
Let's sit for a bit.

265
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,520
You sing.

266
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,600
It's okay.

267
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,080
It's fine. Let's wait for them first.

268
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:30,880
Okay.

269
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,120
Let's sit for a bit.

270
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:38,840
Which side do you want to sit?

271
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,640
Where do you want to sit?

272
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:40,600
Then let's sit here.

273
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,080
Sit here.

274
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,960
Do you think it'll rain later?

275
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,640
Lightning.

276
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:54,240
Actually, a little rain would be nice.

277
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,240
Hello.

278
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,480
You're back.

279
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,320
Hello.

280
00:09:59,320 --> 00:09:59,960
Hello.

281
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:04,960
Look at them, holding hands.

282
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,240
Come grab something to eat.

283
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,640
We finally get to grill some meat today.

284
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:08,920
That's right.

285
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,080
Smells so good.

286
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:10,870
Wow.

287
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,440
I'm starving.

288
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,280
There's food over there.

289
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,520
You guys can take a look.

290
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:15,440
We have steak.

291
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,640
Have some.

292
00:10:18,990 --> 00:10:20,560
I'm going to eat some crab.

293
00:10:21,180 --> 00:10:23,160
(Support)
Use my knee to help yourself up.

294
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:24,320
Yeah.

295
00:10:26,140 --> 00:10:27,920
- How do we add each other on WeChat?
- I'll add you first.

296
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,000
- Okay.
- Scan it.

297
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:30,080
Here.

298
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,200
Like this?

299
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:31,840
Scan mine.

300
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,640
So, are you happy today?

301
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,800
Are you happy today?

302
00:10:38,980 --> 00:10:40,540
(Staring)

303
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:41,920
I am.

304
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:43,960
Were you happier today
or the past few days?

305
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,280
Today. Definitely today.

306
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:46,680
What about you?

307
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:48,140
I've actually been happy
these past few days.

308
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:48,940
You've been happy every day.

309
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,480
Are you happy today?

310
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,100
(Asking again)
Yeah.

311
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:54,080
Happy.

312
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:00,840
What's wrong?

313
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:05,160
You're spacing out again.

314
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,760
No, I'm just thinking about something.

315
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:08,440
I'm interrupting you.

316
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,320
Want some lamb?

317
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,440
I'll take one, Yu Yang.

318
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,840
Is today everyone's cheat meal?

319
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,880
Absolutely.

320
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:15,880
We have to indulge.

321
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:17,520
Thanks.

322
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,680
So good.

323
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,560
It smells amazing. Want some?

324
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,640
Sure, thanks.

325
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,000
So good. Yu Yang grilled it.

326
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:31,280
It's delicious.

327
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:33,680
Let's raise a glass.

328
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:35,480
I'll have another one then.

329
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,400
Come on.

330
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,200
Yu Yang.

331
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,520
Actually, can I say a few words?

332
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:42,160
Hold on.

333
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,000
Do we need a mic? A microphone?

334
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,120
The mic.

335
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,480
Here.

336
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,480
The mic.

337
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,960
Here.

338
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,640
You definitely need a microphone.

339
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:49,440
Come on.

340
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:50,640
You have to have one.

341
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:51,960
That's pretty loud.

342
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,320
You need to stand inside the circle.

343
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,920
Right.
You have to stand inside the circle.

344
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,560
Stand in the circle.

345
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,460
Come on.

346
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:57,340
Come on, we need to sit properly.

347
00:11:57,340 --> 00:11:58,120
We need to sit down.

348
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,080
(Cheering)
We're going to sit down.

349
00:11:59,080 --> 00:11:59,760
No need to go that far.

350
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,240
Yu Yang, come on.

351
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:00,720
Have a seat.

352
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:01,920
Alright.

353
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,400
Everyone, take your seats.

354
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:08,680
It's our last day here.

355
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:11,080
Actually, a couple of days ago,

356
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,880
when we were all talking
about our last day,

357
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,440
I could

358
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,720
barely

359
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:19,640
hold back my tears.

360
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,720
I really hate
to say goodbye to everyone.

361
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,040
Every day I've spent with all of you

362
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,320
has been unforgettable.

363
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,680
And I hope our friendship

364
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,080
always stays...

365
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,140
Sweet as honey.

366
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:33,840
Yeah, sweet as honey.

367
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:34,800
That's good.

368
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:35,700
Sweet as honey.

369
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,600
Yeah.

370
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,040
So I'm really happy

371
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:39,520
that I got to meet everyone here.

372
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,760
I hope we can all keep in touch

373
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:41,840
after the show.

374
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,200
And

375
00:12:42,500 --> 00:12:44,160
let's hang out if we get the chance.

376
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:45,160
You're always welcome.

377
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,120
Okay, I think that's enough.

378
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,040
Is that okay?

379
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:52,440
Don't...

380
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,120
Don't make it so formal.

381
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,400
We've known each other
for quite a while now.

382
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:56,600
We're really happy we met you too.

383
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:57,640
Of course you are.

384
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,120
Come on.

385
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,440
Give Mr. Chen

386
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,360
a "seat of honor".

387
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:01,640
Move it to the middle.

388
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:02,720
Don't do this.

389
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,880
Why don't we put on some music?

390
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:08,920
It's getting a little quiet

391
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:09,960
after my speech.

392
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,000
Let's sing a song.

393
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,680
Here, this is good.

394
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:14,760
Let's sing something.

395
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:15,560
What should I sing?

396
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:18,620
♪Friends forever will walk on♪

397
00:13:18,620 --> 00:13:20,520
- Bring on the backing track.
- I'll just sit here.

398
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,720
Play the backing track.

399
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:22,080
Sure.

400
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:24,160
Let's sing the one I sang at the...

401
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,200
Okay.

402
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,480
The one I sang at the dinner party.

403
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:27,120
Who Do You Love?

404
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:27,440
One more.

405
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,280
That's great.

406
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:29,360
Welcome.

407
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:30,620
Does anyone...

408
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:31,480
Does anyone want to sing with me?

409
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,640
I'm a little nervous.

410
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,160
You.

411
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,480
Can you quietly sing
a couple of lines for me?

412
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,120
Sing a little.

413
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,880
That's something for later.

414
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:39,960
I just...

415
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:40,760
Just a little.

416
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,800
Just a little for me.

417
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,240
If you're shy...

418
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,720
We can talk about it later.

419
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:54,160
♪In the dark, neither of us said a word♪

420
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:56,600
♪You just wanna go home♪

421
00:13:57,360 --> 00:14:00,000
You kissed my forehead.

422
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:01,720
I missed it.

423
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:02,760
Let me kiss you again.

424
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:07,440
♪Deep loneliness feels like
a frightening sea♪

425
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:10,800
♪Your gentle hands♪

426
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:12,480
Has anyone ever heard you sing?

427
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,360
♪Softly run through my hair♪

428
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:14,960
Yes.

429
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:18,520
♪Your eyes tell me♪

430
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:22,840
♪How much you want me to hold you♪

431
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:26,480
♪Yet your body fights to get away♪

432
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:31,000
♪As desire starts to burn♪

433
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:31,640
Awesome!

434
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:32,240
Let's sing together.

435
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:32,760
Together.

436
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:33,360
Keep going.

437
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:39,640
♪Do you love me or him?♪

438
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:44,960
♪Is he really better than me?♪

439
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:48,560
♪Who are you struggling over?♪

440
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:54,880
♪Do you love me or him?♪

441
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:59,480
♪I'd rather hear the painful truth♪

442
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:03,120
♪I'm just that foolish♪

443
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,240
Why does that sound so weird?

444
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,720
So happy.

445
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:15,920
♪I don't want you to leave♪

446
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:19,160
♪Distance can't keep us apart♪

447
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:22,000
♪My longing for you is like the ocean♪

448
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,320
Change the key.

449
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:25,120
♪It can't get in through the window♪

450
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:28,480
♪I forgave you too fast♪

451
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:32,000
♪Love became an obstacle♪

452
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:38,080
♪The kite in my hands flew too far
to come back♪

453
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:41,440
♪I don't want you to leave♪

454
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:44,480
♪I can't let go of the memories♪

455
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:47,520
♪I still owe you my love♪

456
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:50,720
♪I'm waiting for another chance♪

457
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:54,280
♪The sky is still bright♪

458
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:57,480
♪It still loves the sea♪

459
00:15:57,480 --> 00:16:00,120
♪Our love song may have lost♪

460
00:16:00,540 --> 00:16:05,080
♪But love still remains♪

461
00:16:08,920 --> 00:16:10,080
Heart Signal 9,

462
00:16:10,230 --> 00:16:12,960
Friends Forever and Ever!

463
00:16:16,580 --> 00:16:20,580
(Crushes may fade,
but we'll stick around)

464
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:24,140
(May this meeting
make the most of our youth)

465
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:27,020
(Beijing)

466
00:16:27,180 --> 00:16:28,360
(After Bohan and Xing's confession)
Let's sit.

467
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,320
Then we'll sit over here.

468
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,800
Sure, we'll sit over here.

469
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:31,360
Sure.

470
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:34,200
Your stomach can only handle congee,

471
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:34,960
so you've got to sit here.

472
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:36,160
(Pulls out a chair)
And I've got to sit here.

473
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,600
Do you want some?

474
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:43,680
I bet

475
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:44,640
this is the one you want most.

476
00:16:44,860 --> 00:16:45,820
(Stir-fried rice noodles with shrimp)

477
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:46,720
Right?

478
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:47,320
Yep.

479
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:48,760
(Teasing)
Yep, and this one's your second pick.

480
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:49,840
(Steamed pork ribs
with fermented black beans)

481
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:51,280
Si knows you so well.

482
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:52,880
She's got it all planned out for me.

483
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,160
Alright then.

484
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:55,960
Let's dig in.

485
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:56,800
Let's eat.

486
00:16:58,040 --> 00:16:59,280
Such a big bowl.

487
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:00,240
Look at this huge bowl of congee.

488
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,200
Are you having congee?

489
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,480
No more congee for me.

490
00:17:04,660 --> 00:17:05,440
All these food,

491
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:06,840
and I'm asking if you want congee.

492
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:09,840
Which one do you want?

493
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,080
I'll try this one.

494
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:13,760
I'll put it in your bowl.

495
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:19,600
Actually, tofu like this,

496
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:20,640
you can probably eat too, right?

497
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,440
This smaller piece.

498
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,160
Give it a try.

499
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:24,760
Open your mouth.

500
00:17:25,260 --> 00:17:27,580
(Feeds)

501
00:17:35,980 --> 00:17:37,660
(Serves food)
Thanks.

502
00:17:38,380 --> 00:17:39,740
(Serves food x2)

503
00:17:40,140 --> 00:17:41,300
(Serves food x3)

504
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:46,000
It's been two weeks already.

505
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:48,280
Yeah.

506
00:17:48,280 --> 00:17:49,240
Two weeks just flew by.

507
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,440
It's gone by pretty fast.

508
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:53,040
So what did you guys eat yesterday?

509
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:55,600
Barbecue.

510
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:56,480
Was it good?

511
00:17:57,540 --> 00:17:58,320
It was actually pretty good.

512
00:17:58,320 --> 00:17:58,920
Pretty good.

513
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:03,800
Once you're better,

514
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:05,720
the four of us will have a proper meal.

515
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:06,720
A proper meal.

516
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:10,200
You still haven't had

517
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:10,960
the top-ranked shrimp.

518
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:15,560
If you could eat,

519
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:16,480
what would you want most?

520
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:18,360
Out of this whole spread,

521
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:19,840
I'd probably go for a shrimp first.

522
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:26,840
I had so much to say for my confession,

523
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:29,080
and I only got through half of it.

524
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:32,040
Because we had our confessions first.

525
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:33,840
I told him over and over

526
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:35,240
to make sure he said everything
he wanted to.

527
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:36,920
If you don't get it all out,

528
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:38,560
you'll regret it when you think back.

529
00:18:38,560 --> 00:18:39,960
But I got to the point where

530
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,880
I had no idea
where I even was. I just...

531
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:42,880
said whatever came to mind.

532
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:45,680
So do you feel like there was

533
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:47,520
anything you didn't get to say?

534
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:49,520
Was there?

535
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:52,880
Probably.

536
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:55,480
But I was too nervous, couldn't help it.

537
00:18:56,430 --> 00:18:58,240
You could totally see
how nervous he was.

538
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:59,360
He was super nervous.

539
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:00,160
Who?

540
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:00,920
Cui Yihang.

541
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,240
Did I seem off? Compared to normal.

542
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:03,480
Not off.

543
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,000
A little off.

544
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:04,960
Not off.

545
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:06,400
(Joking)
Weirdly handsome, huh?

546
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:11,320
It feels like the four of us are

547
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:12,360
having a Chinese New Year's Eve dinner.

548
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:14,640
Like we're a family.

549
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:16,480
Not "like" a family.

550
00:19:16,900 --> 00:19:17,860
(Laughs)

551
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,320
We "are" a family.

552
00:19:22,040 --> 00:19:23,840
I wish you

553
00:19:25,790 --> 00:19:27,200
lots of sweetness

554
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:28,120
real soon.

555
00:19:28,770 --> 00:19:30,040
Real soon.

556
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:31,480
Well, how about right now?

557
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:33,940
(Holding hands)

558
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:35,440
Annoying.

559
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:36,680
"Annoying".

560
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:42,280
I hope we can

561
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:43,840
become a real family soon.

562
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:46,960
We're on the same page now.

563
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:48,240
What she says is

564
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:49,880
exactly what I want to say.

565
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:51,240
The boss' orders

566
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,240
mean your orders.

567
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:52,640
Yeah.

568
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:53,440
You could say that.

569
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:02,680
So it was only after leaving
the Signal House

570
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:04,160
that you guys felt

571
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:06,120
things suddenly heat up, right?

572
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:11,160
I felt like we got closer.

573
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:15,760
I don't know if he did.

574
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:18,280
(Joking)
Quick, say you did too.

575
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:20,200
I totally did.

576
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:22,840
Totally did.

577
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:33,640
Do you ever sneak a look

578
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:35,320
